  "source": {
    "origin": "engine-default",
    "reason": "an original layout authored for this project, not a reproduction of any map from the source game. Zones hug the lane because tower ranges are in the same units as the map, and a zone placed further away than the cheapest tower can shoot is a zone nothing can be usefully built in. Coordinates are in the same units tower ranges are published in, so the map is sized so a cheap tower covers a meaningful share of it rather than six percent of its width"
